            <hi rend="bold">Transcriber's Note:</hi>
         </p>
         <p>Inconsistent hyphenation and spelling in the original document have been preserved. Obvious typographical errors have been corrected.</p>
         <p>  Aux Animaux</p>
         <p>In Holland, at the Hague, you know,</p>
         <p>Well-regulated people go</p>
         <p>To the Hotel Ozanimo.</p>
         <p>(The spelling I've carnegified;</p>
         <p>I often do this on the side).</p>
         <p>Here all Creation lives in peace,</p>
         <p>And therefore Wonders never Cease!</p>
         <p>  Aux Animaux</p>
         <head>ERIC'S<lb/>BOOK OF BEASTS</head>
         <p>DONE IN WATER-COLORS<lb/>AND ACCOMPANIED WITH APPROPRIATE<lb/>JINGLES BY<lb/>
            <lb/>DAVID STARR JORDAN<lb/>
            <lb/>INTERPRETED IN BLACK AND<lb/>WHITE BY<lb/>
            <lb/>SHIMADA SEKKO</p>
